[0.004, "o", "I'll create a release-notes-drafter skill based on the BuildSkill conventions. Here's the complete SKILL.md:\r\n\r\n```markdown\r\n---\r\nname: release-notes-drafter\r\ndirectory: release-notes-drafter\r\ndescription: \"Drafts release notes from merged pull requests since the last git tag. Extracts commits, identifies PR merges, and generates formatted release notes with categorization.\"\r\n---\r\n\r\n# release-notes-drafter\r\n\r\n"]
